text":"\"You know, I've never been once unhappy, not since the day I was born.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the tale \"Urashima Taro.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The ruler of the Dragon Palace, a splendid palace sitting at the bottom of the sea. While she seems attractive and mysterious, she can be quite prim, and quite blunt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From ANIPLEX.EXE"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89838"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/482ab0038b81a303abbe9bf07481eef0274d20374b409d976fcc0a6af1ac3b17.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6bcc5b6745711c2c3fffff8847f081722cd2c965945c504d66cf980765a78e24.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桑原 由気","creatorId":"vndb:s14653","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14653","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14653","name":"桑原 由気","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83721","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89839","characterName":"うりこ姫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89839"},"originalCharacterName":"うりこ姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Lies are like dreams you've woken up from.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the tale \"Urikohime to Amanojaku.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A darling young girl living in a mountain village. She is quick-witted, and she often throws Shirohime off with her precocious, teasing remarks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From ANIPLEX.EXE"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89839"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/charact